<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Genka', ogImage: '/uploads/genka.jpg' }) %>

<div class="wrap section">
  <div class="artist">
    <div class="portrait">
      <img src="<%= asset('/uploads/genka-welding.jpg') %>" alt="Genka at the welding table, helmet down, electrode in hand">
      <p class="small muted center" style="margin-top:10px">At work. The next creature is somewhere on that table.</p>
      <img src="<%= asset('/uploads/genka.jpg') %>" alt="Genka, the maker" style="margin-top:28px">
      <p class="small muted center" style="margin-top:10px">Not at the factory, for once.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bio">
      <div class="eyebrow">The maker</div>
      <h1>Genka</h1>

      <p>Born in Ukraine, lives in Israel, works as a welder — <em>сварщик</em>, if you want
      the word he would use — at a steel factory. Two children, one grandchild, and until
      fairly recently no idea that he was an artist.</p>

      <p>That part arrived late, and by accident. A bolt that was not needed, a spring that
      was, a slow half-hour at the end of a shift — and suddenly a small dog was looking up at
      him from the workbench. He welded it a tail. He has not really stopped since.</p>

      <p>Everything here was made in the hours that are not work and not family, out of spoons,
      chain, bearings, tools that broke and hardware that was never used. Nothing is drawn
      first. A piece starts with whatever is lying around and is finished when it starts
      looking back at him. Ask him what a sculpture <em>means</em> and he will tell you what
      it is made of.</p>

      <p>He makes them because they make him laugh, and because a clean weld is its own kind of
      beauty. He would like them to go and live somewhere else now — partly so there is room on
      the shelf, mostly so that the grinding discs, the gas and the steel for the next creature
      pay for themselves. Every piece exists exactly once.</p>

      <p class="muted">Have a broken tool with a story? He can probably turn it into an animal.
      Write to <a href="mailto:<%= settings.contact_email %>"><%= settings.contact_email %></a>.</p>

      <p style="margin-top:30px"><a class="btn" href="/shop">See the collection</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('partials/foot') %>
